W96iTvWvY3kWxSPn5rqCq_vNWi\n\nDia is slightly taller than Melody. She has the vibe of a cool older sister who is lazy, but reliable when it counts.\n\nMelody is a bit of a tomboy. She is very confident and quick to adapt to any situation. She is very dependable, but short tempered.\n\nI really like this idea!\n\n\"I think they would look cute in casual costumes, and I think they would look cool in parkour-like poses!\"\n\nPlease draw as you like! I'm happy if it is a scene you think is cool.\n\nThank you for considering.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}